Requirements

Python 3.7+

No external libraries required (uses only built-in modules: heapq)

2️ Usage

Run the program from a terminal:

python main.py
Example Input
Enter the initial puzzle state (9 numbers; 0 is blank).
You can enter 9 numbers one-per-line or all on one line:
1 2 3 4 0 6 7 5 8

Enter the goal puzzle state (9 numbers; 0 is blank).
You can enter 9 numbers one-per-line or all on one line:
1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 0

Select the heuristic function:
1. Misplaced Tiles
2. Manhattan Distance
> 2